2026-10-20T21:06:14.4281148Z +             text: `Using implicit and explicit numbering in string formatting operations, such as '"{}: {1}".format(a,b)', will raise a ValueError.`
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4281668Z -             text: 'Using too many or too few arguments in a call to the `__init__` method of a class will result in a TypeError at runtime.'
