2026-10-20T21:06:14.4509223Z +               '* If validation of a tuple is intended, then you should define an `assert` statement for each element of the tuple.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4509931Z -               'If the overridden method does not depend on the instance `self`, and only on its class, consider making it a `@classmethod` or `@staticmethod` instead.\n' +
