2026-10-20T21:06:14.4511566Z -               'If calling an overridden method is absolutely required, consider marking it as an internal method (by using an `_` prefix) to discourage external users of the library from overriding it and observing partially initialized state, and ensure that the fact it is called during initialization is mentioned in the documentation.\n' +
