2026-10-20T21:06:14.4619582Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4619709Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4620237Z +               'Replace uses of `exit()` and `quit()` with `sys.exit()` which is built into the interpreter and is guaranteed to be present.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4621001Z -               'If you want to define properties in a class, then ensure that the class is a new-style class. You can convert an old-style class to a new-style class by inheriting from `object`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4621212Z                 '\n' +
