2026-10-20T21:06:14.4777091Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4778357Z -               'To explicitly declare a class as unhashable, set `__hash__ = None`, rather than defining a `__hash__` method that always raises an exception. Otherwise, the class would be incorrectly identified as hashable by an `isinstance(obj, collections.abc.Hashable)` call.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4778447Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4778544Z -               '\n' +
