2026-10-20T21:06:14.4813462Z -               'In the following example, only the `__lt__` operator has been implemented, which would lead to unexpected errors if the `<=` or `>=` operators are used on `A` instances. The `__le__` method should also be defined, as well as `__eq__` in this case.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4813552Z                 '\n' +
