2026-10-20T21:06:14.4985666Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4989961Z -               '* Override the attribute in the subclass to implement the correct behavior.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4990875Z -               '* Modify the class hierarchy and move equivalent or redundant methods to a common super class.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4991730Z -               '* Modify the method hierarchy, breaking up complex methods into constituent parts.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4992365Z -               '* Use delegation rather than inheritance.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4992894Z                 '\n' +
