2026-10-20T21:06:14.5047917Z +               'An assignment statement evaluates a sequence expression and assigns each item of the sequence to one of the variables on the left. If there is a mismatch between the number of variables on the left and the values in the sequence on the right of the statement, then an exception is raised at runtime.\n' +
