2026-10-20T21:06:14.5444036Z               'problem.severity': 'error',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5444153Z               'sub-severity': 'low',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5444616Z +             description: 'Assigning a variable to itself is useless and very likely indicates an error in the code.',
