2026-10-20T21:06:14.5501729Z -               'A formatting expression, that is an expression of the form `the_format.format(args)` or `format(the_format, args)`, can use explicitly numbered fields, like `{1}`, or implicitly numbered fields, such as `{}`, but it cannot use both. Doing so will raise a `ValueError`.\n' +
