2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789205Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789316Z                 '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789515Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789615Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789752Z                 'class Vehicle(object):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5789851Z +               '    \n' +
