2026-10-20T21:06:14.5872936Z +               '* Python Reference: [__init__](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/datamodel.html#object.__init__).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5873356Z +               '* Python Standard Library: [super](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#super).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.5874066Z +               '* Python Glossary: [Method resolution order](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-method-resolution-order).\n',
