2026-10-20T21:06:14.6162954Z +               '* The History of Python: [ Inside story on new-style classes](http://python-history.blogspot.co.uk/2010/06/inside-story-on-new-style-classes.html).\n'
2026-10-20T21:06:14.6163436Z -               '* Python Standard Library: [Regular expression operations](https://docs.python.org/library/re.html).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.6164057Z -               '* Regular-Expressions.info: [Named Capturing Groups](http://www.regular-expressions.info/named.html).\n'
