2026-10-20T21:06:14.6267840Z +             markdown: '# Overwriting attribute in super-class or sub-class\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.6268466Z +               'Subclasses should not set attributes that are set in the superclass. Doing so may violate invariants in the superclass.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.6268714Z -             markdown: '# Duplicate key in dict literal\n' +
